Why We Have Seasons (为什么会有四季) — Textbook Doodle (Lemo-Opuscar)

No AI-generated images, no stock footage, no photographs, no voice. Every page, letter, pen stroke and doodle is drawn by
code in this folder with canvas 2D (engine/*.js, pages.js, film.js); the score is played from sampled instruments by
core/audio/sampler.py and the pen and highlighter foley is synthesised from noise by core/audio/sfx.py (tools/score.py).

LIBRARIES
- numpy, scipy, soundfile (BSD), from the library's .venv.

SAMPLED INSTRUMENTS (fetched by tools/fetch.sh into core/audio/instruments/, not in git)
- VSCO 2 Community Edition (Versilian Studios / Sam Gossner) — CC0 1.0: violins (pizzicato and sustained), cellos
  (pizzicato), clarinet, trombone, French horn, trumpet, timpani, sleigh bells.
- VCSL, Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios) — CC0 1.0: xylophone, glockenspiel, harp, triangle,
  woodblock, shaker.
- MuldjordKit by Lars Muldjord (FreePats edition) — CC BY 4.0: the drum kit.

